{"id":"91b9c548b9e50592","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Boolean Lattice Carrier","display":"df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier — ZFC Order11 Boolean Lattice Carrier","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier — ZFC Order11 Boolean Lattice Carrier","depends_on":["[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier — ZFC Order11 Boolean Lattice Carrier"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in V\">\\(B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\)</span> (canonical Boolean-algebra predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BooleanLatticeCarrier}_S(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BooleanLatticeCarrier}_S(B)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BooleanLatticeCarrier}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B\\;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BooleanLatticeCarrier}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B\\;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a property of the carrier alone: it holds exactly when some operations and constants turn <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> into a Boolean algebra. The witnesses are existential because they are not arguments of the carrier predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BooleanLatticeCarrier}_S(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}boolean\\text{-}lattice\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder11BooleanLatticeCarrier}_S(B)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B\\;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_B,1_B)","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1051,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2879","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier.md|58-df-zfc-order11-boolean-lattice-carrier]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["a5e10857074b912e"]}